{"phosphataseTotalVector"," ","="," ",RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"0",","," ","0",","," ","0",","," ","0",","," ","1",","," ","0",","," ","0",","," ","1",","," ","1"}],"}"}]}],"\n",RowBox[
