{RowBox[{RowBox[{"FullSimplify","[",RowBox[{RowBox[{"Transpose","[","stoichiometricMatrix","]"}],".","#"}],"]"}]," ","&"}]," ","/@","\n","   ","conservationVectors"}]}]}]],
