"\<A(u) has endpoint factors at u = r and u* = \[Minus]\[Beta]/\[Alpha]. The strict inequalities are the analytical detached-branch condition. Under the symmetric iteration constraints, the crossing occurs at u = 1; the factorisation residual is printed as a diagnostic.\>",
